# Authors: Sunni (Sir) Morningstar & Cael Devo
[before]
Is c after a? => !is after
[after]
Is b after a? => is after
Is c after a? => is after
Is e after a? => do not know
Is x after w? => not sure
Is w after x? => not sure
[after-correction]
Is b after a? => not after
Is c after a? => do not know
Is d after c? => is after
Is x after w? => not sure
